  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> are unit vectors and mutually perpendicular vectors and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is equally inclined to all <math><mn>3</mn></math> vectors<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>"
